abstract: "Unbalanced UNITID-by-year panel built from final NCES IPEDS Access databases for 2004-2023. The labeled release full-panel-labels-v1, recorded in docs/codebook/manifest.json, has 141,711 institution-year rows and 2,721 columns. Repository code is MIT. Derived metadata in this deposit is CC BY 4.0. NCES source data remains under NCES terms."
